\series bold
Mega2r.map
\series default
, indicate the input is PLINK ped format with parameters, and indicate that
 Mega2 should produce a database called s
\series bold
eqsimr.db
\series default
, etc.
 (These particular items are in bold face text below.)
\end_layout

