\begin_layout Standard
\noindent
You should compare the two directories: vcf and vcfr.
 Please add the -w flag to the diff command.
 This causes the comparison to ignore differences in white space.
 You may may notice that expressions that contain dates that are different
 between the two directories.
 Type:
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\noindent
\begin_inset Flex Chunk
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout

<<diff>>=
\end_layout

\begin_layout Plain Layout

system("diff -wrs vcf vcfr", intern=TRUE)
\end_layout

\end_inset


\end_layout

